[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:49.655 --> 00:53.482
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

00:53.551 --> 01:00.655
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:01.620 --> 01:03.827
- [crowing]
- [鸡鸣]

01:03.896 --> 01:05.862
- [yawns]
- [哈欠]

01:05.931 --> 01:08.413
[grunting]
Oh, yeah.
[咕噜声]
哦，是的。

01:08.482 --> 01:10.551
There we go.
我们开始吧。

01:11.965 --> 01:13.241
- Hee-hee-hee-hee-hee-hee.
- 嘻嘻嘻嘻嘻嘻嘻。

01:13.310 --> 01:15.413
Fluoride to Desktop,
氟化物到桌面，

01:15.482 --> 01:19.413
I'm in a position to raise no
suspicion, over.
我可以提出反对意见
怀疑，结束。

01:19.482 --> 01:21.172
- Cut the poetry, Wordsworth.
- 剪掉诗歌，华兹华斯。

01:21.241 --> 01:23.068
Did you
get Krab's hair sample yet?
你有吗
拿到蟹老板的头发样本了吗？

01:23.137 --> 01:24.896
- Keep your pants on, woman.
- 穿上你的裤子，女人。

01:24.965 --> 01:30.344
I'm gonna steal his hairs
right out of his razor.
我要偷他的头发
就从他的剃须刀里出来。

01:30.413 --> 01:31.551
- I'll just grab the
razor here...
- 我会抓住
剃须刀这里...

01:31.620 --> 01:34.896
- Wait. No. Auugh.
- 等待。不，哦。

01:34.965 --> 01:39.137
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

01:39.206 --> 01:42.000
[coughing]
[咳嗽]

01:42.068 --> 01:43.517
Ehhh!
呃！

01:43.586 --> 01:45.862
- [whistling]
- [gargling]
- [吹口哨]
- [漱口]

01:45.931 --> 01:47.413
- Now for the rest of it.
- 现在剩下的部分。

01:47.482 --> 01:48.931
- Augh!
- 啊啊！

01:49.000 --> 01:51.896
[groaning]
[呻吟]

01:51.965 --> 01:53.931
- Well, if it isn't my thieving
husband.
- 好吧，如果这不是我偷的
丈夫。

01:54.000 --> 01:55.034
So did you bring me the...
那你给我带来了...

01:55.103 --> 01:57.620
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

01:59.137 --> 02:01.586
- Hair?
- 头发？

02:01.655 --> 02:05.034
I only needed one.
我只需要一个。

02:07.689 --> 02:08.724
- Hee-hee-hee.
- 嘻嘻嘻。

02:08.793 --> 02:11.172
You married a genius,
Karen.
你嫁给了一个天才，
凯伦。

02:11.241 --> 02:13.310
Using the DNA from Krabs'
hair
使用螃蟹的 DNA
头发

02:13.379 --> 02:16.034
and my own DNA from my
antennae...
以及我自己的 DNA
天线...

02:16.103 --> 02:18.448
Ouch!
哎哟!

02:18.517 --> 02:23.517
I will create a combo-clone
of me and Krabs
我将创建一个组合克隆
我和蟹蟹

02:23.586 --> 02:26.724
to finally steal the
secret formula.
终于偷到了
秘密配方。

02:36.241 --> 02:39.241
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

02:43.034 --> 02:45.206
Ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha.
哈哈哈哈哈哈哈。

02:45.275 --> 02:49.551
Behold Plankrab.
看普兰克拉布。

02:49.620 --> 02:51.827
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

02:51.896 --> 02:53.137
Heh-heh-heh.
呵呵。

02:55.310 --> 02:57.758
Arr-arr-arr-arr-arr.
啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊。

02:57.827 --> 02:59.724
- How is this a good thing?
- 这怎么是一件好事呢？

02:59.793 --> 03:01.310
- Wake up, Karen.
- 醒醒吧，凯伦。

03:01.379 --> 03:03.206
The Plankton side will know
everything
浮游生物那边会知道
一切

03:03.275 --> 03:04.724
the Krab side knows.
蟹方知道。

03:04.793 --> 03:08.172
It'll be easier than taking
candy from a baby.
这会比采取更容易
来自婴儿的糖果。

03:08.241 --> 03:12.000
- Mm, and we know how
successful that was.
- 嗯，我们知道怎么做
那是成功的。

03:12.068 --> 03:14.620
- [gobbling]
- [狼吞虎咽]

03:14.689 --> 03:16.137
- This is different,
- 这是不同的，

03:16.206 --> 03:18.689
isn't it,
Plankrab, my pretty?
不是吗，
Plankrab，我的美丽？

03:18.758 --> 03:21.517
Now, here's my plan.
现在，这是我的计划。

03:21.586 --> 03:24.206
- Don't waste your breath,
Plankteron.
- 别浪费口气了
浮游生物。

03:24.275 --> 03:26.896
I already mapped out the
perfect plot
我已经规划好了
完美的情节

03:26.965 --> 03:29.482
to swipe that formuler-ererer.
刷那个配方错误者。

03:29.551 --> 03:31.862
- Great!
See you soon, P.K.
- 伟大的！
很快再见，P.K.

03:31.931 --> 03:34.931
[sighs]
I love that guy.
[叹气]
我爱那个人。

03:35.000 --> 03:36.758
Well, half of him anyway.
好吧，无论如何，他的一半。

03:36.827 --> 03:39.034
Heh-heh-heh-heh-heh-heh.
哈哈哈哈哈哈哈。

03:39.103 --> 03:41.275
[coughing]
[咳嗽]

03:41.344 --> 03:44.172
Still got a hair in there.
里面还有一根头发。

03:44.241 --> 03:46.482
[scatting]
[分散]

03:46.551 --> 03:49.482
Where is Plankrab
with the secret formula?
Plankrab 在哪里
用秘密公式？

03:49.551 --> 03:52.827
It's been over three minutes
already.
已经三分多钟了
已经。

03:52.896 --> 03:54.172
Augh!
啊啊！

03:54.241 --> 03:56.724
- Hmm, ooh.
[grunts]
- 嗯，哦。
[咕哝]

03:56.793 --> 04:00.241
- All right, Twoface,
what's the big idea?
- 好吧，双脸，
有什么大主意吗？

04:00.310 --> 04:02.896
What have you been doing
all this time?
你最近在做什么
一直这样？

04:02.965 --> 04:04.793
- Oh, nothing much-erer.
- 哦，没什么特别的。

04:04.862 --> 04:07.172
Just stealin' the
formuler-erer...
只是偷了
配方师-错误...

04:07.241 --> 04:09.758
- Uh-whaaa?
- 呃-哇？

04:09.827 --> 04:12.344
- Taking over the
restaurant-erer...
- 接管
餐厅-呃……

04:12.413 --> 04:14.517
both: Hooray for Plankrab.
两人：普兰克拉布万岁。

04:14.586 --> 04:16.862
He's the best boss ever.
他是有史以来最好的老板。

04:16.931 --> 04:21.103
- And kicking Krabs out
on his booty-erererer.
- 把蟹蟹赶出去
在他的战利品犯人身上。

04:21.172 --> 04:24.551
- [sobbing]
- [抽泣]

04:24.620 --> 04:26.068
- B-b-but how?
- 但、但怎么办？

04:26.137 --> 04:30.827
- All it took me, Hardy,
was a hearty handshake,
- 我付出了一切，哈代，
是一次热烈的握手，

04:30.896 --> 04:34.896
the world's most persuasive
handshake that is.
世界上最有说服力的
握手就是这样。

04:34.965 --> 04:37.206
It's me latest creation.
这是我最新的创作。

04:37.275 --> 04:39.655
Put her there-erer,
matey.
把她放在那里——呃，
马蒂。

04:39.724 --> 04:41.620
- An evil handshake.
- 邪恶的握手。

04:41.689 --> 04:46.034
That's hands down the
dumbest thing I ever--huh?
这是毫无疑问的
我做过的最愚蠢的事——嗯？

04:46.103 --> 04:48.931
Oh. Ohh. Heh-heh, yeah.
哦。哦。呵呵，是啊。

04:49.000 --> 04:51.793
Oh, ohh, ahh, ahh.
哦哦哦啊啊啊啊

04:51.862 --> 04:54.000
Yeah, yeah. Ahh!
是啊是啊。啊！

04:54.068 --> 04:55.344
Yeah. Ohh-ho.
是的。噢-嗬。

04:55.413 --> 04:59.482
Oh, your handshake is
exquisite.
哦，你的握手是
精致的。

04:59.551 --> 05:01.655
I'd believe anything you say.
你说什么我都会相信。

05:01.724 --> 05:03.931
- Then believe this,
Swabby.
- 那么请相信这一点，
拭子。

05:04.000 --> 05:08.689
I'll also be commandeer-ering
the Chum Bucket from now on.
我也来霸占
从现在开始，密友桶。

05:08.758 --> 05:10.344
- Ahh-ahh.
- 啊啊啊。

05:10.413 --> 05:13.448
Sounds great to me, P.K.
对我来说听起来很棒，P.K.

05:13.517 --> 05:15.413
- And I'm afraid your
services
- 我担心你的
服务

05:15.482 --> 05:18.620
are no longer
required-ererered.
不再是
要求-错误。

05:18.689 --> 05:22.275
- Gosh, I still can't
get over this handshake.
- 天哪，我还是不行
克服这次握手。

05:22.344 --> 05:25.310
Ahh!
啊！

05:25.379 --> 05:26.827
Augh!
啊啊！

05:26.896 --> 05:29.000
I'm over it now.
我现在已经结束了。

05:29.068 --> 05:30.724
- Ahh! Plankton.
- 啊！浮游生物。

05:30.793 --> 05:33.931
Some creepy, one-eyed
crab took me restaurant.
有些令人毛骨悚然，独眼
螃蟹带我去餐厅。

05:34.000 --> 05:36.206
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

05:36.275 --> 05:37.931
- Wait a minute.
- 等一下。

05:38.000 --> 05:40.965
I think he took mine too.
我想他也拿走了我的。

05:41.034 --> 05:45.793
[both sobbing]
[两人都抽泣]

05:45.862 --> 05:48.206
- I-I-I don't know what
happened.
- 我-我-我不知道什么
发生了。

05:48.275 --> 05:51.137
But that was some handshake
of his, huh?
但那是一些握手
他的，嗯？

05:51.206 --> 05:53.103
I mean...hoo-hoo!
我的意思是……呼呼！

05:53.172 --> 05:54.482
- Snap out of the handshake.
- 停止握手。

05:54.551 --> 05:57.620
It's a trick, Krabs.
这是一个诡计，蟹蟹。

05:57.689 --> 06:01.344
A dirty, beautiful trick.
一个肮脏而美丽的把戏。

06:01.413 --> 06:04.344
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

06:04.413 --> 06:11.344
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

06:11.413 --> 06:13.793
- Ahh!
- Ahh!
- 啊！
- 啊！

06:16.689 --> 06:18.517
- [grunting]
- Ugh!
- [咕哝]
- 呃！

06:21.655 --> 06:26.379
- Say, his Krabby Patty tastes
even better than usual.
- 比如说，他的蟹黄饼口味
甚至比平时更好。

06:26.448 --> 06:28.206
What's in it,
SpongeBob?
里面有什么，
海绵宝宝？

06:28.275 --> 06:30.137
- Well, it's the same old
patty,
- 嗯，还是老样子
帕蒂,

06:30.206 --> 06:33.689
except now each one has a pinch
of chum added.
只是现在每个人都有一点点
密友补充道。

06:33.758 --> 06:37.931
- A pinch of ch-ch-ch-chum?
- 一点ch-ch-ch-chum？

06:39.655 --> 06:42.206
- Good work, me boy-o.
- 干得好，我的孩子。

06:42.275 --> 06:45.103
- Wow.
- 哇。

06:45.172 --> 06:47.896
- Me boy-o?
- 我男孩-o？

06:47.965 --> 06:52.724
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

06:52.793 --> 06:55.862
- [sighs] There's only one way
to get
- [叹气]只有一种方法
得到

06:55.931 --> 06:57.965
our restaurants back,
Eugene.
我们的餐厅回来了，
尤金.

06:58.034 --> 07:01.655
- Ahh!
You don't mean...
- 啊！
你不是说...

07:01.724 --> 07:05.931
both: We gotta work together.
双方：我们必须共同努力。

07:06.000 --> 07:08.379
- [coughing]
- [咳嗽]

07:08.448 --> 07:10.310
Hair.
头发。

07:10.379 --> 07:11.620
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

07:11.689 --> 07:13.034
- ♪ Doo-doo-doo ♪
- ♪ 嘟嘟嘟 ♪

07:13.103 --> 07:15.241
Mm-hmm. Mm-mm-mm.
嗯嗯。嗯嗯嗯。

07:15.310 --> 07:16.241
Heh-heh-heh.
呵呵。

07:16.310 --> 07:17.241
♪ Doo-doo-doo ♪
♪ 嘟嘟嘟 ♪

07:17.310 --> 07:20.482
[whistling]
[吹口哨]

07:20.551 --> 07:23.379
[both chuckling]
[两人都笑了]

07:25.000 --> 07:26.448
- Hey, what the...
- 嘿，这是什么……

07:26.517 --> 07:31.448
[all grunting]
[全都咕哝]

07:31.517 --> 07:33.965
- Hee-hee, hee-hee-hee,
hee-hee.
- 嘻嘻，嘻嘻嘻，
嘻嘻。

07:34.034 --> 07:35.275
- Ugh!
- 呃！

07:35.344 --> 07:37.137
- Heh-heh-heh-heh-heh.
- 嘿嘿嘿嘿嘿嘿。

07:37.206 --> 07:38.241
both: Ohh!
两人：哦！

07:38.310 --> 07:40.103
- [whistling]
- [吹口哨]

07:40.172 --> 07:41.793
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

07:41.862 --> 07:45.275
He may have taken our
restaurants,
他可能夺走了我们的
餐馆,

07:45.344 --> 07:49.310
but we'll take his customers.
但我们会带走他的顾客。

07:49.379 --> 07:51.689
[both chuckling]
[两人都笑了]

07:52.896 --> 07:54.344
[bell dings]
[铃声]

07:54.413 --> 07:55.448
[laughter]
[笑声]

07:55.517 --> 07:56.862
- This way.
- 这边走。

07:56.931 --> 07:57.689
[horn honks]
[喇叭鸣响]

07:57.758 --> 08:00.172
Drive-thru. Literally.
得来速。字面上地。

08:00.241 --> 08:03.379
both: Waahhh!
两人：哇啊啊！

08:03.448 --> 08:05.103
- [whistling]
- [吹口哨]

08:05.172 --> 08:07.344
- All right, all right.
- 好吧，好吧。

08:07.413 --> 08:10.344
I can't go any lower, Eugene.
我不能再低了，尤金。

08:10.413 --> 08:13.068
Please make it stop.
请让它停止。

08:13.137 --> 08:15.586
- Ehhh...ugh!
- 呃……呃！

08:15.655 --> 08:18.068
- It looks like there's
only one way
- 好像有
只有一种方式

08:18.137 --> 08:19.586
out of this one, Sheldon.
从这个中，谢尔顿。

08:19.655 --> 08:21.620
- Oh, no. You don't mean...
- 哦，不。你不是说...

08:21.689 --> 08:25.034
- Yeah. I'm afraid so.
- 是的。恐怕是这样。

08:25.103 --> 08:29.137
- [whirring]
- [呼呼]

08:29.206 --> 08:32.068
- That'll be all for
now, Spongematey.
- 这就是全部了
现在，海绵宝宝。

08:32.137 --> 08:34.793
- Oh, could I just have one
more handshake, Captain?
- 哦，我可以要一份吗
还要握手吗，队长？

08:34.862 --> 08:38.103
- [chuckles]
Sure as yer born.
- [轻笑]
当然，就像你出生的那样。

08:38.172 --> 08:40.103
- Ohh.
- 哦。

08:40.172 --> 08:44.896
- So you two scallywags
want to work for me, eh?
- 所以你们两个无赖
想为我工作，是吗？

08:44.965 --> 08:46.310
both: I wanna be the manager.
两人：我想当经理。

08:46.379 --> 08:47.482
Arrgh.
啊啊。

08:47.551 --> 08:49.413
- Well, you're both in luck.
- 嗯，你们都很幸运。

08:49.482 --> 08:52.275
It just so happens I'm looking
碰巧我正在寻找

08:52.344 --> 08:55.344
for two new manager-erers...
对于两位新任经理...

08:55.413 --> 09:00.137
- Ahh!
- Yeah!
- 啊！
- 是的！

09:00.206 --> 09:03.413
- To manage me toilets.
- 帮我管理厕所。

09:03.482 --> 09:08.206
[chuckling]
[轻笑]

09:08.275 --> 09:11.965
Well, here's another fine mess
you've gotten us into.
好吧，这是另一个混乱的地方
你让我们陷入了困境。

09:12.034 --> 09:15.000
- [whimpering]
- [呜咽]

09:15.068 --> 09:16.517
[coughing]
[咳嗽]

09:16.586 --> 09:18.620
Hair.
头发。

09:18.689 --> 09:21.620
[both grumbling]
[两人都抱怨]

09:21.689 --> 09:24.689
- The humiliation
in here stinks.
- 羞辱
这里很臭。

09:24.758 --> 09:26.655
- This is all your fault,
Plankton.
- 这都是你的错
浮游生物。

09:26.724 --> 09:29.275
I'm gonna keel haul yer
face at lunchtime.
我要龙骨拖你
午餐时的脸。

09:29.344 --> 09:30.586
- Why wait?
- 为什么要等？

09:30.655 --> 09:33.206
Let's take a coffee break.
Pow!
让我们休息一下，喝杯咖啡。
噗！

09:36.310 --> 09:39.551
- Ohh.
- Argh.
- 哦。
- 啊。

09:39.620 --> 09:44.551
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

09:44.620 --> 09:48.241
Swirly.
旋涡状。

09:48.310 --> 09:49.965
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

09:54.310 --> 09:58.137
- Hey, I am trying to read.
- 嘿，我正在努力读书。

09:58.206 --> 09:59.275
Ahh! Hey!
啊！嘿！

09:59.344 --> 10:01.068
Ahh! Ahh!
啊！啊！

10:01.137 --> 10:04.172
- [chuckling]
- Ehh-ehh...ehh.
- [轻笑]
- 呃呃……呃。

10:04.241 --> 10:05.655
- Hmm?
- 唔？

10:05.724 --> 10:09.689
- Two guys...fighting...
toilet paper everywhere
- 两个人……打架……
到处都是卫生纸

10:09.758 --> 10:12.482
- Oh, yeah?
- 哦，是吗？

10:12.551 --> 10:17.206
Who's defiling me
rester-ererooms?
谁玷污我
休息室？

10:17.275 --> 10:20.896
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

10:20.965 --> 10:22.689
- He did it.
- He did it.
- 他做到了。
- 他做到了。

10:22.758 --> 10:23.793
- No, he did it.
- No, he did it.
- 不，他做到了。
- 不，他做到了。

10:23.862 --> 10:24.827
- No, he did it.
- No, he did it.
- 不，他做到了。
- 不，他做到了。

10:24.896 --> 10:28.344
- Hmm? Hmm? Hmm? Hmm?
- 唔？唔？唔？唔？

10:28.413 --> 10:29.793
- Get off of him, Plankton.
- 离开他，浮游生物。

10:29.862 --> 10:32.344
- It was obviously Krabs'
fault.
- 这显然是蟹老板的
故障。

10:32.413 --> 10:33.689
- Why are you siding
with Plankton?
- 你为什么站在一边
与浮游生物？

10:33.758 --> 10:35.689
- Why are you siding with
Krabs?
- 你为什么站在一边
螃蟹？

10:35.758 --> 10:37.206
- They're arguing.
- 他们在争论。

10:37.275 --> 10:38.413
- And splitting up.
- 然后分手。

10:38.482 --> 10:40.034
- Stop hitting myself.
- Ow.
-别再打自己了。
- 噢。

10:40.103 --> 10:41.482
Stop hitting myself.
别再打自己了。

10:41.551 --> 10:43.103
I'm sick of you.
我厌倦了你。

10:43.172 --> 10:46.344
- What in Neptune's name is
wrong with meself?
- 海王星的名字是什么
我自己有错吗？

10:46.413 --> 10:48.206
Ahh! Oof! Oh!
啊！钱币！哦！

10:48.275 --> 10:49.827
[grumbling]
[抱怨]

10:49.896 --> 10:53.172
- Jeez, is that what
we sound like?
- 天哪，就是这样吗
我们听起来像？

10:53.241 --> 10:56.827
- I hope not, 'cause
that's pathetic.
- 我希望不会，因为
太可悲了。

10:56.896 --> 10:59.413
both: I can't stop hitting
meself,
两人：我无法停止打球
我自己，

10:59.482 --> 11:02.931
because I'm torn.
因为我很伤心。

11:03.000 --> 11:03.724
Arrgh!
啊啊！

11:03.793 --> 11:05.172
[whistles blowing]
[吹口哨]

11:05.241 --> 11:07.206
- All right, you clones,
I want a clean fight,
- 好吧，你们克隆人，
我要一场干净利落的战斗

11:07.275 --> 11:09.034
no rough stuff.
Go back to your corners
没有粗糙的东西。
回到你的角落

11:09.103 --> 11:11.000
when the bell rings
and come out fighting.
当铃声响起时
并出来战斗。

11:11.068 --> 11:15.379
- But first, you gotta
shake hands.
- 但首先你必须
握手。

11:15.448 --> 11:16.931
- Well, fine.
- 好吧，好吧。

11:20.344 --> 11:23.586
both: Ooh, mmm.
两人：哦，嗯。

11:23.655 --> 11:28.448
- Wow, this is a great
handshake.
- 哇，这太棒了
握手。

11:28.517 --> 11:32.655
both: Ehhhh.
两人：嗯嗯。

11:33.586 --> 11:35.724
- Splitting? So soon?
- 分裂？这么快？

11:35.793 --> 11:37.068
[laughter]
[笑声]

11:37.137 --> 11:38.655
- Oh, you.
- 哦，你。

11:38.724 --> 11:40.689
- [coughing]
Hair.
- [咳嗽]
头发。

11:40.758 --> 11:41.689
- Here me, bucko.
- 我在这里，布科。

11:41.758 --> 11:43.586
Let me get that for ya.
让我给你拿一下。

11:43.655 --> 11:45.068
- Bleh!
- 哎呀！

11:45.137 --> 11:47.172
- [chuckling]
- [轻笑]

11:47.241 --> 11:48.758
Freedom.
自由。

自由。